      "created_at": "2013-11-14T13:32:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Indeed, you can sell such a promo for $$$ if you are interested (people actually do pay a lot for a single card). I was thinking in getting it from someone that wants to help others. I have several \"rare\" promos from other games (say, an extra black die from Ghost Stories, or heroes/necromancer island from small world), and I am not willing to sell them. They are promotional items made for the fans of the game...and selling them seems to break the spirit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>If anyone feels as I do and has an extra copy...well, they will make a happy building community. Until then, I will keep on looking :)</span></p>",
